# And: always continues the nearest Show:/Hide: group in the same block.
Screen: Dashboard

  Element: Widgets
    When: The user is an administrator
    Show: Sales chart
    And: User list
    Hide: Upgrade banner
    And: Trial notice
    Show: Audit log
    And: System status
    Enable

    When: The user is a guest
    Disable
    Hide: Sales chart
    And: User list
    And: Audit log
    Show: Upgrade banner
